            <td><strong>Resources</strong></td>
            <td>
                • Materials (<code>/materials/</code>)<br>
                • Vendors (<code>/vendors/</code>)<br>
                • Customers (<code>/customers/</code>)<br>
                • Material Requests (<code>/material-requests/</code>)
            </td>
            <td>Pengelolaan master data sumber daya bahan baku, mitra bisnis (pemasok & pembeli), serta serah terima material pabrik.</td>
        </tr>
