            <td><strong>Manufacturing</strong></td>
            <td>
                • Bill of Materials (<code>/bill-of-materials/</code>)<br>
                • Routing (<code>/routing/</code>)<br>
                • Work Order (<code>/work-orders/</code>)
            </td>
            <td>Perencanaan resep produk (BOM), urutan stasiun kerja (Routing), dan Surat Perintah Kerja (SPK) produksi.</td>
        </tr>
